=== PARITY (web source reproduced end-to-end) ===
  - Data sources (web useTranslation; the leaf is fed `latest: SecurityEvent | undefined`
    by its parent): bound through the P1/S8 seam WindowStatusSource -> WindowStatusModel.
    The snapshot carries the four window signals (string|boolean|null, exactly the web
    SecurityEvent field union) + load status + ADR-013 connection. No HTTP in the view.
  - parseWindowState (helpers.ts) ported faithfully incl. its quirks: asNonEmptyString
    => only a non-empty string coerces (boolean/null/absent -> Unknown); "closed"/"0" ->
    Closed; contains "vent" -> Venting; any other non-empty -> Open (the web ladder's
    `lower !== '0'` makes the trailing Unknown reachable only for empty/bool/absent).
    Pinned by tests incl. ajar->Open and "1"->Open.
  - Composition (web FadeIn + h2 + GlassPanel grid):
      • FadeIn(0.15)   -> TSFadeIn(delay: 0.15) (honors Reduce Motion).
      • h2 title       -> WindowStatusHeader, web t('admin.security.windowDetail').
      • 4x GlassPanel  -> WindowPaneCard; windowColor -> tone tint+border
                          (Closed=success/green, Venting=warning/amber, Open=danger/red,
                          Unknown=neutral/gray); windowTextClass -> value color = tone.
      • grid cols 1/2/4-> LazyVGrid(.adaptive(minimum:150)) responsive across iPhone/
                          iPad/Mac.
  - States (ALL rendered, each with a #if DEBUG preview + a model/projection test):
